nodes.body:
 @njhill  @TQCB  gentle ping, since this has been open about two weeks without review.

This fixes a startup regression introduced by #50417. That PR marked EagleLlama4ForCausalLM and EagleMistralLarge3ForCausalLM as SupportsMultiModalEmbeddings, which made their aliased SupportsMultiModal.embed_input_ids reachable. The alias calls _embed_text_input_ids, which these drafters don't inherit, so any multimodal target paired with them crashes during the profile run. Repro and traceback are in #57630.

It still reproduces on main as of today (edaf3e7), and the branch applies cleanly. The fix is ~40 lines with a unit test, and it was verified end to end on 4x L4 with Llama 4 Scout + EAGLE.

